            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nicole73"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This definately tasted just like pizza without the crust. Evenso, it didn't do much for me...I think if I make it again I will try romaine lettuce instead of iceberg. I couldn't just eat this for a meal again. Would be good to take to a potluck.",
            "datePublished": "2003-09-05T04:06:19.200Z"
